--[[
KATO HUB - THE STRONGEST BATTLEGROUNDS (TSB) MENU
Type: LocalScript for Roblox Studio
Install: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts > LocalScript

Integration:
- Listens to PlayerGui.KATOHubGameSelected from KATO_HUB_MainMenu.
- Opens when gameId == "TSB" (or the TSB place id below).
- Hides KATO_HUB_MAIN while this menu is open and restores it on Close.

Design scope:
- Combat, Moveset, Hinh anh, Misc: editable UI layout builder.
  Users can add/remove groups and placeholder buttons during the current session.
  These buttons are visual placeholders; they do not automate or modify gameplay.
- Settings: FPS, ping, frame time, server/session information, interface size,
  transparency, language, and a configurable menu toggle key.

No remote code loading, exploit APIs, automated combat, targeting, or gameplay manipulation.
]]

